  "narrative": "A white canvas with near-black ink, charcoal pills for every primary action, violet links and focus, pastels (mint, butter, peach, sky, lavender, blush) for chips, covers and notes, one light mauve focal card per view, and no black backgrounds and no gradients anywhere. Cerise is a small accent. A left sidebar for the app, a header that searches by asking Pirikoo; the public site shares the language with pastel blobs, the cast and a live board."
